      "principle": "A daughter of the first wife is entitled to a definite share in ancestral and joint family properties.",
      "held": "From the evidence placed on record in both suits, it is established that suit properties have fallen to the share of defendant No.1 S.R. Jaganna and therefore, as the daughter of his first wife, plaintiff Gayathri is entitled for definite share in the same along with defendant No.1 S.R. Jaganna.",
